{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066237/block/singleImage/3280936/df/01M8GEKXWYAG7XS4AHQ8D9HH4Z.jpg?updatedAt=1795853954\"/><figcaption>屯門建發里一幢工業大廈外牆棚架起火。(真. 屯門友Facebook)</figcaption></figure><p>今日（28日）下午2時許，屯門建發里2號一幢工業大廈有外牆的棚網起火，火勢經消防灌救約半小時後已大致救熄。消防灌救期間，有200人被疏散到安全地方。 從網上影片可見，棚架陷火海，火光熊熊，濃煙席捲半空；消防正向火場射水。消防接報趕抵現場，出動用煙帽隊灌救。現場亦有一輛救護車到場戒備，起火原因有待調查。</p><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 am730（@am730hk）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:56:18.016050+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:51:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:09:49.189626+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:49:43.738718+00:00","content_hash":"5305c6f2544910e03fa685ace944d0ccab3c3c440ad2c226ad10926f4f94b604","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:56:18.016050+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}